 "stimulus_html": "You are about to roll a special 6-sided die that has both a colored letter and a colored number on each face. The faces are labeled with: a red 1 and a blue A, a red 1 and a green A, an orange 1 and a green B, an orange 2 and a red C, a purple 3 and a brown D, an orange 4 and a blue E. Find the given conditional probabilities:",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516681,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"P({\\text{the letter is a vowel}}{|}{\\text{the number is orange}})\">P({\\text{the letter is a vowel}}{|}{\\text{the number is orange}})</span>",
   "answers": [],
