    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{3}\">\\frac{1}{3}</span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Sample space:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Letter side</td>\n<td>Red 1</td>\n<td>Red 1</td>\n<td>Orange 1</td>\n<td>Orange 2</td>\n<td>Purple 3</td>\n<td>Orange 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number side</td>\n<td>Blue A</td>\n<td>Green A</td>\n<td>Green B</td>\n<td>Red C</td>\n<td>Brown D</td>\n<td>Blue E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>What is the probability of a vowel given that an orange has been rolled?</p>\n<p>An orange has been rolled, which means that one of these sides is the result.</p> \n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Orange 1</td>\n<td>Orange 2</td>\n<td>Orange 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green B</td>\n<td>Red C</td>\n<td>Blue E</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Vowels: E.</p>\n<p>From these choices, <span data-math=\"{\\text{P}}\\left( {{\\text{letter us a vowel | the number is orange}}} \\right){\\text{ }} = \\frac{1}{3}\"></span>.</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516682,
